        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: бронировать",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "бронировать (bronírovat) — \"to book, to reserve\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "бронировать (bronírovat) is built on бронь, \"a reservation\", from броня, \"armour\": a booking shields a seat. броня was probably borrowed, Vasmer says, from Gothic brunjō, \"a breastplate\"."
            }
          ]
        },
